[0m[32mThe beauty of this approach is that it reinforces the constitutional principle of limited government. The Founding Fathers understood that unchecked government power leads to tyranny. A balanced budget amendment would be an important safeguard, ensuring government stays within its constitutional limits and answers to the people's economic interests rather than special interests and bureaucratic expansion.
