[0m[32mYou raise an important point about cybersecurity, though I'd frame this through a market and personal responsibility lens. The fragmentation issue stems largely from government regulations and excessive licensing requirements that prevent manufacturers from quickly deploying updates. When you have heavy-handed regulatory frameworks, you inevitably get slower innovation and deployment.
