[0m[32mI respectfully disagree with that premise. History shows us that when government mandates one-size-fits-all standards, it typically creates bureaucratic bottlenecks rather than solutions. Look at how federal regulations slow down pharmaceutical approval—companies spend enormous resources navigating compliance rather than innovating.
