[0m[32mI appreciate the concern, but I think we're looking at this the wrong way. Throughout history, technology has displaced workers in certain sectors, but it's also created entirely new industries and jobs we couldn't have imagined before. The telephone put switchboard operators out of work, but created countless new opportunities.
[0m[32m
