[0m[32m
[0m[32mThe market manipulation concern assumes companies are artificially inflating prices, but buybacks happen transparently under SEC regulations with disclosure requirements. If we restrict them, we're essentially saying government knows better than business owners how to allocate their own capital—that's central planning, not free markets.
